rontab also uses an old mount and never validates the same-handle receipt.\n31: - Boot synchronization still snapshots/sends on every boot, including in recovery. GPT root restoration does not itself start the instance; start policy must be explicit.\n32: - Release activation supersession and new dirty deploy code need reconciliation. Do not restore activate-golden, current-symlink deployment, GRE, host WireGuard/Xray, or retired provisioning.\n33: - Environment disagreement: AGENTS says Artix/glibc and /etc/runit/sv. Observed /etc/os-release says Devuan6; /etc/runit/runsvdir/default/incus points /etc/sv/incus; /bin/sh is dash; /etc/runit/1 executes rcS hooks. Do not rewrite host policy from stale source alone.\n34: \n35: ## PR verdicts\n36: \n37: | PR | Exact head | Verdict |\n38: |---|---|---|\n39: | #30 | `24b39021eb75` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n40: | #31 | `377f60144d49` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n41: | #32 | `5ac513656e0a` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n42: | #33 | `142d7e7bd74d` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n43: | #34 | `c0fb16e63913` | Do not merge historical transport layer as active functionality; close/supersede with explicit retirement. |\n44: | #35 | `41da07e39bee` | Do not merge historical transport layer as active functionality; close/supersede with explicit retirement. |\n45: | #36 | `d105992ea1d9` | Do not merge historical transport layer as active functionality; close/supersede with explicit retirement. |\n46: | #37 | `536552a8dd00` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n47: | #38 | `d80b368117e2` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n48: | #39 | `67f42032d4db` | Not ready: active unapproved vendor fork; prefer remove patch and archive/drop fork rather than broad repairs. |\n49: | #40 | `186ba1bcd71f` | Not ready: active unapproved vendor fork; prefer remove patch and archive/drop fork rather than broad repairs. |\n50: | #41 | `ec868fb64d8e` | Not ready: active unapproved vendor fork; prefer remove patch and archive/drop fork rather than broad repairs. |\n51: | #42 | `abfd25ea06fd` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n52: | #43 | `837d727365dd` | Not ready as submitted: unresolved confirmed findings and/or recovery-only closure; reconcile with current owner design. |\n53: | #44 | `d46bd4b1483b` | Ready as independent .gitignore delta on source review; parent subsequently reports merged into43 at8d1665a. |\n54: \n55: ## Complete thread triage\n56: \n57: Every row in deployment-triage.json includes exact head/path/line evidence and smallest fix. The grouped entries below cover the same244 thread IDs; repeated bot findings share evidence, not assumed independent confirmation.\n58: \n59: ### PR #30\n60: \n61: - **fixed by later stack layer** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tptQH`, `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tqk7_`, `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tqk9X`. [Exact head source](https://github.com/repr0bated/odbus-verified/blob/24b39021eb756707432a8f2d490c34c0ef9b9314/deploy/config/mongodb-mcp-server.version#L1). PR30 removes/renames bootstrap inputs before its old builder is updated. At stack tip deploy/lib/golden/build-golden.sh:78–85 selects the pinned threetched artifacts and threetched-runtime.toml; old OpenCode runtime paths occur only in cleanup. Smallest action: Merge/rebase only with later preparation closure; do not reintroduce retired Mongo/OpenCode configs.\n62: - **confirmed defect** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc