ne as a proven escalation.\r\n\r\n### PR #38\r\n\r\n- **confirmed defect** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tpt-F`. [Exact head source](https://github.com/repr0bated/odbus-verified/blob/d80b368117e231acaeea26d7b1ada938f43d8bbf/vendor/tched-router/patches/0002-stateless-provider-generation.patch#L4758). 0002 patch Binding::admit around4755 requires sled_identity::current(); ordinary WebSocket chat lacks the stateless branch's VerifiedSledIdentity scope. Mounted discovery therefore fails despite a valid caller credential. Smallest action: Verify SID1 and scope the regular WebSocket request/turn before mounted tools run, preserving receiver claims and isolation.\r\n- **confirmed defect** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tpt-J`. [Exact head source](https://github.com/repr0bated/odbus-verified/blob/d80b368117e231acaeea26d7b1ada938f43d8bbf/vendor/tched-router/patches/0003-threetched-branding.patch#L10528). 0003 branding patch:10522–10528 changes test input prefix to /threetched but leaves expected URL containing /zeroclaw; helper forwards the prefix. Smallest action: Update the expected branded path consistently.\r\n- **confirmed defect** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tpt-M`. [Exact head source](https://github.com/repr0bated/odbus-verified/blob/d80b368117e231acaeea26d7b1ada938f43d8bbf/vendor/tched-router/patches/0003-threetched-branding.patch#L12977). 0003 patch:12975–12986 makes architecture tests require renamed DMG/Scoop paths, while the patch does not update the corresponding pinned workflow paths. Smallest action: Align pinned workflow changes and architecture assertions, preserving upstream provenance; no tests were run.\r\n- **false positive** — `PRRT_kwDOUgxzzc6tpuPU`. [Exact head source](https://github.com/repr0bated/odbus-verified/blob/d80b368117e231acaeea26d7b1ada938f43d8bbf/vendor/tched-router/patches/0003-threetched-branding.patch#L17). Owner explicitly renamed the executable to lowercase threetched; PR38 builder and PR43 export inputs implement that contract. Restoring zeroclaw branding would vio